    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "How might we make Ferpa Lima’s expertise feel as credible and approachable online as it is in practice?"
            }
          ],
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "kind": "subheading",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "PROBLEM FRAMING"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "The live site carried strong credentials (PhD, publications, CREF) but buried them under dense copy and uneven visual hierarchy. Prospective clients struggled to understand the consultancy offer, pricing paths, and why Ferpa’s main differentiator (individualized, science-prescribed routines) was different from generic fitness coaching. SEO on the live Wix site was also messy, which hurt discoverability for health, weight-loss, and special-group search intent."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Audience",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Current core: mainly women and gay men roughly 20-45, with strong LGBT community overlap; motivations around health and weight loss, plus a need for a supportive space that helps overcome aversion to fitness. Expansion targets to surface more clearly: pregnant clients, older adults, people with diabetes, TAF (physical fitness test) prep, and chronic pain."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Constraints",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Stay on Wix for payment processing and finance accountability; design within Wix builder capabilities (plans/checkout, forms, SEO settings). Desktop-first marketing site; preserve brand colors (green/blue); keep Portuguese product copy and academic credibility; no fake promises or hype-led claims; improve conversion toward consultancy without inventing new product lines. Full SEO remediation planned for implementation on Wix, outside this Figma UI pass."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
