    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Before",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Live / capture screens relied on long text blocks, flat headers, and limited visual rhythm. Credentials were present but hard to scan, and pricing lived buried inside longer pages."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "After",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "A focused redesign of four core pages (homepage, pricing, about, and contact) with hero storytelling centered on individualized science-based training, first-class plan cards, scannable credentials, inclusive audience signals, and a dedicated contact surface."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "kind": "subheading",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "RESEARCH"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Audit overview",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Mapped the existing ferpalima.com.br structure into a hub-and-spoke sitemap to clarify page hierarchy and relationships before redesigning. Earlier captures (homepage composite, about, consultoria, blog, policies, exercises) completed the current-state set."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Heuristic findings",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Primary CTA and pricing paths competed with long informational sections"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Academic credentials were strong but visually underweighted vs. marketing sites"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Page-to-page navigation existed, but section rhythm made skimming difficult"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Live-site SEO needed cleanup (titles, meta, headings, and Wix SEO settings) to match exercise-science and audience search intent"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Evidence from usage",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Stakeholder meeting notes set the brief: keep Wix for payments and finance accountability; lead with credible, evidence-based exercise science (no fake promises); treat individualized routine as the main differentiator; fix SEO; serve the current audience (women and gay men 20-45, LGBT community, health and weight loss, supportive / anti-aversion tone); and surface special groups (pregnancy, older adults, diabetes, TAF, chronic pain). Those goals prioritized the four-page redesign."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
