            {
              "text": "DESIGN PRINCIPLES"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Principles prioritized credibility and conversion without diluting the science-led brand or inventing outcome promises."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Lead with the differentiator: individualized, science-prescribed routine before deep biography"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Make trust scannable: testimonials, credentials, and publications as distinct beats; no fake promises"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Package decisions: pricing cards and CTAs as first-class UI, mapped to Wix-friendly checkout and contact patterns"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Signal audience clearly: inclusive / supportive tone for LGBT clients and people returning to fitness, plus scannable special-group coverage"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Tradeoff: denser academic content moved onto About so the homepage and pricing page could convert faster. Specialists still reach bio and publications without friction. SEO cleanup stays an implementation task on Wix rather than a Figma deliverable."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "kind": "subheading",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "SOLUTION"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "The redesign focuses on four primary public pages drawn from the old structure’s highest-priority visitor paths: Homepage (story + individualized offer), Pricing (dedicated plans), About (credibility and inclusive identity), and Contact (conversion). Compositions stay Wix-implementable. Portfolio screenshots below use English translations of those frames for an international audience; the live Brazilian product remains in Portuguese."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
